---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy | QShala - Walnut Knowledge Solutions Private Limited"
  description="Read the official privacy policy of QShala (Walnut Knowledge Solutions Private Limited), detailing our commitment to data protection, child safety, and student privacy."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", item: "/" },
    { name: "Privacy Policy", item: "/privacy-policy" }
  ]}
>
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content" class="flex-grow pt-header-safe pb-24 px-6 bg-[#FFFDF5]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 border-2 border-black shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-heading mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-6 font-medium">
        <p>At QShala (Walnut Knowledge Solutions Private Limited), we are fully committed to protecting the privacy and security of our users, particularly the children who engage with our platform.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-heading mt-8 mb-4">1. Data Collection</h2>
        <p>We collect necessary information such as names, email addresses, and contact details during the registration or inquiry process. We also collect anonymized usage data to improve our trivia mechanics and user experience.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-heading mt-8 mb-4">2. Child Safety & COPPA Compliance</h2>
        <p>We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13 without verifiable parental consent. All communication and data related to minors are securely handled and never shared with third-party advertisers.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-heading mt-8 mb-4">3. Use of Information</h2>
        <p>The information we collect is strictly used to deliver our services, process payments, provide customer support, and communicate updates about our quriosity clubs and corporate programs.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-heading mt-8 mb-4">4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement industry-standard encryption and robust security protocols to protect your data from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.</p>

        <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-500 italic">Last updated: October 14, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
